{"results":[{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/73-east","title":"73 East In Kandivali West | Buy 2 & 3.5 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Kandivali West](/buy/mumbai/kandivali-west-1a256b7a71)\n\n>\n\nDimple Group\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Dimple_Group-73_East--Bedroom-1640346917.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Dimple_Group-73_East--Bedroom-1640346876.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Dimple_Group-73_East--Bedroom-1640346883.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Dimple_Group-73_East--Bedroom-1640346892.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/Dimple_Group-73_East--Bedroom-1640346908.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/241221043803-Dimple.png)\n\n# 73 East\n\n73 East, Mahatma Gandhi Rd, off Link Road, Mahatma Gandhi Nagar, Kandivali West , Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067\n\nKandivali West\n\n₹1.8 Cr - 3.29 Cr\n\n₹1.8 Cr - 3.29 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\n73 East is a premium luxury residential project in Kandivali West, Mumbai, designed for those who aspire to experience the exclusive Sundeck Life. Offering spacious and customizable 2 & 3.5 BHK luxury homes in Kandivali, this low-density development features pillar-free bare shell residences with expansive private sundecks and breathtaking city views. Crafted with iconic architecture and intelligent layouts, 73 East allows homeowners the flexibility to design their living spaces as per their preferences without compromising on comfort or elegance. Strategically located in a well-developed neighborhood of Mumbai, the project enjoys seamless connectivity and is surrounded by top schools, shopping malls, hospitals, and recreational hubs within a 2 km radius. With its combination of premium design, prime location advantage, and exclusive lifestyle amenities, 73 East stands out as an exceptional investment opportunity and a distinguished residential address in Kandivali West.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK, 3.5 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2025\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹22,500/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n802 - 1462 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Premium Luxury Residential Project in Kandivali West.\n* Exclusive pillar-free bare shell residences for customization.\n* Smartly planned layouts with maximum space utilization.\n* Gated community with advanced security features.\n* Close proximity to malls, schools, hospitals & recreational zones.\n\n* Spacious 2 & 3.5 BHK homes.\n* Large private sundecks with panoramic city views.\n* Modern lifestyle amenities & clubhouse facilities.\n* Excellent connectivity to Western Express Highway & key city hubs.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nCustomer Satisfaction: Generally positive feedback with a Google rating of 4.2/5 based on approximately 68-70 reviews. Space & Design: Reviewers frequently highlight the unusually large carpet areas and spacious sundecks compared to other projects in the vicinity. Location: Users appreciate the proximity to the Dahanukar Wadi Metro Station and Link Road, facilitating easier commutes. Construction Quality: Many comments mention the \"luxury\" feel of the bare-shell apartments and the reputation of Dimples Group for timely delivery.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nGenerous Living Space\n\nOffers significantly larger configurations, including 818 sq. ft. 2 BHKs and 1462 sq. ft. 3.5 BHKs.\n\nStrategic Connectivity\n\nLocated within 350 meters of the metro station and close to M.G. Road.\n\nHigh Customization\n\nBare-shell units and pillar-free designs allow residents to design interiors according to personal preference.\n\nPrivacy & Density\n\nLow-density project with only 6 flats per floor and 7 dedicated lifts to ensure minimal wait times.\n\nExternal Amenities\n\nFeatures a rooftop/podium level with over 30 facilities, including a swimming pool and sky deck.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nSurrounding Environment\n\nThe approach road and immediate neighborhood include slum settlements, which some reviewers find unappealing.\n\nTraffic & Noise\n\nBeing near major junctions leads to high noise levels and heavy traffic congestion during peak hours.\n\nLimited Land Parcel\n\nThe project is built on a relatively small plot (approx. 1.27–1.7 acres), leading to a single-tower structure with vertical amenities rather than sprawling grounds.\n\nVisitor Parking\n\nSome feedback points to a lack of adequate parking space specifically for guests.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nIdeal for Space Seekers\n\nBest for Commuters\n\nPremium but Dense\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLandscape Garden\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary.svg)\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-secondary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/Lobby-1-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Lobby-1-secondary.svg)\n\nWell Designed Entrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLandscape Garden\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Multi-purpose-court-primary.svg)\n\nMultipurpose Hall\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-primary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/swimming-pool-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/swimming-pool-primary.svg)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![amenities/walking-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-primary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/Lobby-1-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Lobby-1-primary.svg)\n\nWell Designed Entrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-primary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK\n\n3.5 BHK\n\n* ## 802 sq. ft\n* ## 818 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n2 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹1.80 Cr\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/dimple-group-73-east-2-bhk-swimming-pool-1723628090.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![hospital-primary](/assets/icons/hospital-primary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![school-secondary](/assets/icons/school-secondary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nSahayak Multispeciality Hospital\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nChavan Hospital, Dahanukarwadi\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nDr. Chirag Mehta'S Health Centre\n\n0.5 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nDiamond Orthopedic & Multispeciality Hospital\n\n0.6 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nRms Multispeciality Hospital & Icu/Iccu - Best Neurosurgery, Spine And Joint Replacement Centre In Kandivali West\n\n0.7 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nSumangal Hospital\n\n0.8 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹1,88,566per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹2,26,27,917\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\n73 Eastis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800015343](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800015343)\n\n73 East\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for 73 East?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of 73 East is 30 Dec 2025\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of 73 East?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for 73 East is 802 - 1462 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of 73 East?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of 73 East is ₹1.8 Cr - 3.29 Cr\n\n### Where is 73 East located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n73 East is located at 73 East, Mahatma Gandhi Rd, off Link Road, Mahatma Gandhi Nagar, Kandivali West , Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.\n\n### What configurations are available in 73 East?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\n73 East has 2 BHK, 3.5 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of 73 East?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of 73 East is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in 73 East?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Landscape Garden, Large Green Area, Multipurpose Hall, Senior citizen Area, Swimming Pool, Walking Area, Well Designed Entrance Lobby, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of 73 East?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of 73 East is Dimple Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for 73 East:Dimple Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/241221043803-Dimple.png)\n\n## Dimple Group\n\nEstablished in 1998, Dimples Group is a premier construction company in Mumbai. Their commitment to creating superior quality and technologically advanced projects has earned them immense trust and customer satisfaction. Dimples Group offers a diverse portfolio of projects that caters to both budget and luxury home sectors. For instance, La Vista in Borivali East provides luxurious living amidst greenery, La Belleza offers a blend of serenity and modernity, while La Senza is set to become a commercial hub. With the successful completion of projects like Gayatri Avenue, Sagar and Sterling, Dimples Group continues to enhance the magnificence of the city of Mumbai.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/je-vee-infrastructure-shree-gopaldham-elevation-1762949548.jpg)\n\n![Shree Gopaldham](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/240522105543-jeeandvee.png)\n\nShree Gopaldham\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.45 Cr - 5.64 Cr\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rudra-amar-group-shivani-rudram-elevation-1755173792.jpg)\n\n![Shivani Rudram](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/260525085623-newproject-2025-05-26t205415973.webp)\n\nShivani Rudram\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.08 Cr - 2.34 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/ambit-builders-and-developers-ambit-primoris-elevation-1743572617.webp)\n\n![Ambit Primoris](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/300923111153-newproject-2023-09-30t111141705.webp)\n\nAmbit Primoris\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.98 Cr - 3.96 Cr\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/jadeite-developers-llp-jadeite-kaveri-elevation-1744186266.webp)\n