nstruction-kandivali-west-1a256b6a1b7a71)\n\n[![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)](/)\n\n### OVERVIEW\n\n* [About Us](/about)\n* [Contact Us](/contact)\n* [Careers](/careers)\n* [Terms & Conditions](/terms-conditions)\n* [Privacy Policy](/privacy)\n\n### EXPLORE\n\n* [Developers](/developers)\n* [Blogs](/blogs)\n* [Press Mentions](/press-mentions)\n* [EMI Calculator](/calculator/emi-calculator-homeloan)\n\n### CITIES WE SERVE\n\n* [Kolkata](/kolkata)\n* [Mumbai](/)\n* [Navi Mumbai](/navi-mumbai)\n* [Pune](/pune)\n* [Thane](/thane)\n* [Alibaug](/alibaug)\n* [Bangalore](/bangalore)\n* [Noida](/noida)\n* [Palghar](/palghar)\n* [Raigad](/raigad)\n* [Telangana](/telangana)\n\n### FOLLOW US\n\n[![facebook-primary](/assets/icons/facebook-primary.svg)](https://www.facebook.com/blox.xyz/)[![instagram-primary](/assets/icons/instagram-primary.svg)](https://www.instagram.com/blox.xyz/)[![linkedin-primary](/assets/icons/linkedin-primary.svg)](https://www.linkedin.com/company/blox-xyz/mycompany/)[![twitter-x-primary](/assets/icons/twitter-x-primary.svg)](https://twitter.com/blox_xyz)[![youtube-primary](/assets/icons/youtube-primary.svg)](https://www.youtube.com/@BloxPropTech)[![mail-primary](/assets/icons/mail-primary.svg)\n\nEmail us at:](mailto:hello@blox.xyz)\n\n---\n\nMumbai H/O\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nMethod & Madness Technology Pvt. Ltd., Unit No. 1202, 12th floor, One International Center, Tower-3, Senapati Bapat Marg, Mumbai, Maharashtra - 400013\n\nRERA ID : A51900029429\n\nOffice no 303, Platinum Square, Sakore Nagar, Viman Nagar, Pune, Maharashtra - 411014\n\nRERA ID : WBRERA/A/NOR/2026/000949\n\nOffice no : 7W84C, 7th Floor, West Block, Mani Casadona, Plot No. IIF/04, Action Area- IIF, Newtown, Kolkata, West Bengal - 700160\n\n---\n\n© Copyright 2026Blox.xyz","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_dimples-73-east-kandivali-west_3660.html","title":"Dimples 73 East Kandivali West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | PropertyCrow.com","raw_content":"![PropertyCrow.com](/propertycrow-logo-sm.svg)\n\n1. [New Projects](https://www.propertycrow.com/)\n›2. [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)\n›3. [New Projects in Kandivali West](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_new-projects-in-kandivali-west_1_1_0_0_90.html)\n›4. [Dimples 73 East](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_dimples-73-east-kandivali-west_3660.html)\n\n![Dimples 73 East](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3660/photo-24919.jpeg)\n\n![Dimples 73 East](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3660/photo-24919.jpeg)\n\n![ Dimples 73 East ](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3660/photo-24920.jpeg)\n\n![ Dimples 73 East ](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3660/photo-24921.jpeg)\n\n![ Dimples 73 East ](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3660/photo-24922.jpeg)\n\n![ Dimples 73 East ](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3660/photo-24923.jpeg)\n\n![ Dimples 73 East ](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3660/photo-24924.jpeg)\n\nby Dimples Realtors\n\n# Dimples 73 East\n\nMG Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 2 BHK & 3.5 BHK Apartments\n\nSize 748 Sq.ft To 1462 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice ₹1.75 Cr Onwards\n\nCall Now +919769025551\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow3660\n\nPossession Status Possession Expected Around December 2024\n\nRERA P51800015343  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## DIMPLES 73 EAST\n\n**Dimples 73 East** is one of the residential developments of Dimples Group, placed in Mumbai. The project offers large and masterfully developed 2 BHK & 3.5 BHK Apartments with starting area from 748 Sq.ft To 1462 Sq.ft Carpet Area as a affordable value. It is well prepared with all the facilities\n\nto facilitate the requires of the people.\n\nKandivali West is a suburb placed at the junction of Mahatma Gandhi Road and Link Road. From an farming land to a residential hotspot, this area has surfaced as a vibrant real estate location providing good connection to industrial hubs such as Bandra Kurla Complex, Goregaon and Andheri. It is just a 30-minute drive from Chhatrapati Shivaji International Airport and 32 minutes from the Santacruz Airport. Popular colleges and universities in the area include Swami Vivekananda International School and Junior College, Shree Jamnadas Adukia Balika Vidyalaya and Junior College. Popular dining places in the area involve The d Indian Sizzlers, The Village and Martins Chinese Nook.There is also metro line coming up from Andheri to Dahisar which is currently under construction.\n\nDimple Realtors Pvt. Ltd. was established in the year 1997 and today they stand as one of the best names that are taken when it comes to accountability of the best in the business.  They treat their clients with utmost importance as their views and feedback are the most important for the group. They have high aspirations and goals for the benefit of the group as well as their clients.\n\n**For more information on floor plans, sales brochure, resale choices, investor flats, possession & rent option please contact us.**\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Grand | 748 | 1.75 CR |\n| 2 BHK Premium | 802 | 1.88 CR |\n| 3.5 BHK Elite | 1462 | 3.42 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\* Lift(s)  \n\\* 24/7 Water Supply  \n\\* Fire Fighting Systems  \n\\* Car Parking\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n**Floorings:**  \n\\* Kitchen: Italian Marble  \n\\* Living/Dining: Italian marble  \n\\* Master Bedroom: Wooden flooring  \n\\* Other Bedroom: Wooden Flooring   \n  \n**Fittings:**  \n\\* Kitchen: Modular Kitchen  \n\\* Toilets: Branded CP and Sanitar  \n  \n**Walls:**  \n\\* Kitchen: Ceramic Tiles Dado  \n\\* Toilets: Ceramic Tiles Dado up to\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3660/qra_1773.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800015343\n\n**Developer:** Dimples Realtors\n\n**Project:** Dimples 73 East\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - MG Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** MG Road, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** MG Road, New Link Road & Mahatma Gandhi Nagar\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about DIMPLES 73 EAST\n\nWhere is Dimples 73 East Exactly located?\n\nDimples 73 East is located at MG Road, Kandivali West, .\n\nIs Dimples 73 East Rera Registered?\n\nYes, It is RERA Registered with Rera Number P51800015343. You can verify the details on the official RERA website.\n\nWhat are unit options available in Dimples 73 East?\n\nDimples 73 East offers 2 BHK & 3.5 BHK Apartments.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Apartments in Dimples 73 East?\n\nThe starting price of Apartments at Dimples 73 East is 1.75 Cr Onwards. Contact us for the latest pricing and offers.\n\nWhen is the Possession of Apartments?\n\nThe expected possession date for Dimples 73 East is Possession Expected Around December 2024.\n\nWhat are the nearest landmarks?\n\nKey landmarks near Dimples 73 East include Sainathi auto works, Tree house play group, Sagar super market, Pizzaht dresitrct restaurants, Rahul medical store, Andhra bank, Rubiinus fitness and spa, Kandivali railway station & kandivali police station.\n\nIs Dimples 73 East, approved by Banks for Home Loans?\n\nYes, Dimples 73 East is approved by leading banks and financial institutions for home loans. Contact us for assistance with your home loan application.\n\n## Share This Project\n\nSimilar Properties\n\n## Similar Properties in Kandi