ts/Files/Projects/998/Amenities/998_1678021357_93b6110df81e6c5e25f2c2bc6df3d9f8.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Location of Dimple 73 East in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 27404](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/998/Location/998_1678021357_8bad54c6804890f6d7cdb16ba2ab39da.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n## Project Overview of Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n216 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n1.12 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 49 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nA project built by the Dimple Group that flourished your mind with beauty at first glance. 73 East is a project that gives you extraordinary vibes. So, when can you set a bench, why settle for the ordinary.  \n  \nThe developers have been involved in crowning the city skyline, reflective of those who defy the norms. The project is truly worth considering among multiple options available in the market. Residents here will never get bored as the building has high-tech amenities such as an Infinity Swimming pool, Recreational zones, Kids playing area, a cafe, and many more.  \n  \nThe building is in the middle of many landmarks, connecting you seamlessly, such as Arya Women's Hospital, St. Joseph's High School, Raghuleela Mall, and many others. Curating opulence, an angular aesthetic design that tailors a buyer's mind towards this property. Truly, this property has widened many eyes.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Dimple 73 East in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 453299](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/998/BHK_Configuration/998_1678021357_13762d5ff21e3533f0c67d762145f022.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n818 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n2.65 Cr\n\n![3.5 BHK Flat in Dimple 73 East in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 453300](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/998/BHK_Configuration/998_1678021358_491b2fe08a3c59540522e8d5d3e55cdc.webp)\n\n3.5 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1462 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n4.71 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Fire Safety.\n* Continuous Water Supply.\n* Well Structured Parking Facility.\n* Well Programmed Lifts.\n* In-Built Social Arenas.\n* Seamless Connectivity.\n\n## Amenities Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Lift\n* Power Back Up\n* Solar Power\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* Parking and transportation\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Pool Deck With Sun\n* Swimming Pool\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Kids Pool\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* Access Controlled Lift\n\n* Themed Landscape Garden\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Laminated Flush Doors\n\n## Google Map Location of Dimple 73 East Kandivali West\n\n## Locality Overview of Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Kandivali West](/location-review/mumbai/kandivali-west-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Kandivali West region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Kandivali West is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nDimple 73 East is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51800015343](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800015343)\n\nProject: Dimple 73 East\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Dimple 73 East Kandivali West\n\n---\n\n* Nirmal Junior College\n* Shri T.P. Bhatia College of Science\n* KES Shroff college\n* Hebron School\n\n* BMC HospitaI\n* Saraswati Hospital\n* Namaha Hospital\n* Lotus Multispeciality Hospital\n\n* Thakur Mall\n* Sunrays Shopping Center\n* V Mall\n* D Mart\n\n* Sainath Refreshment\n* The Dessert Clubb\n* Diann's\n* Deepalis Only Veg\n\n![Dimple Group](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Developer/FirmLogos/401_1678040170_untitled-141.webp)\n\n## [Dimple Group](/mumbai/sale/builder/dimple-group-401)\n\nOngoing Projects: 3\n\nCompleted Projects: 17\n\nTotal Projects: 20\n\n---\n\nDimple Group is shaping the course of real estate in Mumbai, and building quality, trustable projects. The company laid its foundation in the year 1998 and has since mastered the art of curating the best projects across Mumbai.  \n  \nThey have added more glamor to the city's skyline and earned a lot of goodwill with the best customer base. They have developed over 12 lakh sqft, with over 20+ projects, and bring smiles to the face of more than 5000 customers. 19 North, Aspire, Sagar and Madhuban are some of their developments. They keep the customer's desire in mind and curate modern and realistic developments.  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Dimple Group](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/dimple-group-401)\n\n## About Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nWhen you are assessing the home of Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai, you are probably considering a home that allows you to live the real life and not just compare the property rates. This project will target buyers that are more interested in organised apartment communities in which layouts, maintenance systems and durability are a priority over visual attractiveness in the short-term.\n\nAs opposed to concentrating on pure aesthetics, the development has a strong focus on effective planning and even residential density. The reason why many of the buyers who are considering to buy an [apartment in Mumbai](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/property/flat) shortlist such projects is that it is a blend of newer construction and the comfort of an already established suburban neighbourhood.\n\n## **Who Dimple 73 East Fits Consultation**\n\n**Dimple 73 East may generally suit:**\n\n* Professional workers who want to live in apartments in an orderly manner.\n* Planning long-term self-use by small and mid-sized families.\n* Customers replacing old residential societies.\n* House consumers who are price sensitive and space conscious.\n\n**It may not be suitable for:**\n\n* Customers who want standalone villas or bungalows.\n* People who like high-density developments.\n* Investors were the short-term resale only investors.\n\nThis simplicity makes buyers make a fast decision on whether the project meets their expectations of style of living or not.\n\n## **Life in the Neighborhood of the Project**\n\nThe people of Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai are influenced to live everyday lives due to a residential neighborhood, which does not promote everyday commercial traffic. The residents usually have an average rate of living where commuting, access to groceries, and routine chores are not hectic.\n\nThe neighbourhood has more end users than some of the [homes in Mumbai localities](https://houssed.com/location-review/mumbai) thus forming a stable residential environment that families and long term home owners are more attracted to.\n\n## **Configuration Planning/Space Usability**\n\nThe homes are designed without considering the brochure presentation but the real life use. The space of the rooms, the circulation of movement within the room, and the position of the window are used to affect the level of comfort following furniture preparation.\n\n**Such important points of usability are:**\n\n* There is a clear definition of the living and personal areas.\n* Privacy and ventilated bedrooms.\n* Optimal layouts with minimum use of space.\n\nTo the buyers who consider [2BHK homes in Mumbai](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/2bhk), the layouts will ensure mutual family interaction and the comfort of each of them.\n\n## **Status and Clarity in Projects Status and possession**\n\nLearning about the construction stage will assist customers to fix unrealistic expectations before making a choice. The site visit will enable one to assess the quality of finishing and its development.\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Aspect | Why It Matters |\n| Construction stage | Demystifies visible project progress |\n| Site preparedness | Assists in the evaluation of actual environments |\n| Possession clarity | Allows more planning in moves in |\n\nIn case the project is under [Ready To Move Projects in Mumbai](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move) to be sold, customers get more confidence on the timelines and occupancy.\n\n## **Comfort and Society Living Long-Term**\n\nThe key to the long-term comfort lies in the functionality of the residential society once it has been possessed. The quality of the maintenance, profile of the residents, and the planning of the shared space affect the daily living more than the first impressions.\n\nProjects that are densely built with reasonable common areas are normally easier to maintain and therefore appropriate to those families that intend to live longer.\n\n## **Cost of Living (Beyond the Price)**\n\nBuyers of Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai must also take into consideration the recurrent cost of living besides the price of the property.\n\n**Common continuing costs can be:**\n\n* Maintenance charges of society.\n* Electricity and water bills\n* Parking-related costs\n* Periodic repair and upkeep\n\nContemporary trends tend to offer organized systems of maintenance, enabling citizens to organize the spending in a more predictable way.\n\n## **Older Residential Buildings Nearby vs Dimple 73 East**\n\nThere are numerous consumers who are comparing newer developments and those resale properties that are located in the same location and the disparity is usually evident after several visits.\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Feature** | **Dimple 73 East (2026 Luxury Standard)** | **Older Residential Buildings Nearby** |\n| **Structure & Height** | **Iconic High-Rise:** A massive G+9P+40 storey tower (one of the tallest in the lane). | **Low/Mid-Rise:** Predominantly G+7 to G+14 standalone wings or old MHADA blocks. |\n| **Architectural DNA** | **Pillar-Free Design:** Bare-shell residences allowing for 100% custom layouts. | **Fixed/Legacy:** Internal pillars and load-bearing walls limit renovation flexibility. |\n| **Internal Volume** | **Grand Heights:** Floor-to-floor height of **3.3m to 4.2m**, creating a villa-like feel. | **Standard:** Conventional 9.5 ft heights; often feels \"boxed-in\" after false ceilings. |\n| **Living Decks** | **Private Sundecks:** Large sky decks for panoramic views of the city & mangroves. | **Enclosed Balconies:** Usually small \"flower beds\" or balconies enclosed with grills. |\n| **Amenity Suite** | **30+ Global Amenities:** Includes an infinity pool, sky gym, steam room, and jacuzzi. | **Minimal:** Typically limited to a shared courtyard or a small community room. |\n| **Parking Logistics** | **Ample Podium:** 7 levels of dedicated podium parking with EV charging sub-meters. | **Restricted:** Mostly open-to-sky surface parking or narrow stilt areas; very limited. |\n| **Space Efficiency** | **Vast Carpet Areas:** Massive configurations (2 BHK at 818 sq. ft. up to 6 BHK at 3977 sq. ft.). | **Compact:** Older units often have smaller carpets but higher \"super built-up\" areas. |\n| **Safety & Security** | **AI-Integrated:** 24/7 CCTV, Video Door Phones, and solid RCC Frame (Seismic Zone III). | **Manual:** Simple gated entries; legacy fire systems; manual elevator doors. |\n\nTo buyers who are considering [new residential projects in Mumbai](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/flats/possession/new-projects), newer residential projects tend to minimize uncertainties with regards to repaired and upgraded projects.\n\n## **Security, Personal Space & Family Wellbeing**\n\nThe residential property in Mumbai is an area that requires safety and privacy when choosing residential properties to live in.\n\n**The project is in a systematic residential plan in which:**\n\n* The movement of entry is restricted.\n* Frequently used areas are well-structured.\n* The households become detached to external activity.\n\nThis assists in developing a less stressful and comfortable living environment.\n\n## **Final Perspective**\n\nPurchasing a house in Dimple 73 East Kandivali west, Mumbai is rather an exercise in quality of life than quality feature. Buyers that place emphasis on practical layout, predictable society living and a stable residential setting, tend to find it a comfortable long term housing option.\n\n## FAQ's about Dimple 73 East Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Kandivali West\n\n* [Apartments in Kandivali West](/mumbai-kandivali.west/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Kandivali W