HK units with deck of sizes ranging from 818 square foot to 1462 square foot.\n\nThe project comes with various modern lifestyle amenities for residents such as Swimming pool, Gymnasium, Landscaped garden and Sauna room, High speed elevator, Grand lobby, CCTV survillence and much more.\n\nKandavali has easy connectivity to Mumbai through the Western Railways. Zenith Multi-speciality Hospital, Mayur Cinemas and Charkop Market are in close proximity from the project.\n\n[#### Amenities](javascript:void(0);)\n\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/02/6311be078ba2d9-85820372.jpg)Car Parking\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05052c6e003-72578577.jpg)CCTV\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/07/63183c02c3bac4-84599175.jpg)Elevator\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/63107763be47b0-83341525.jpg)Intercom\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/02/6311ccc6f0b008-45922935.jpg)jacuzzi\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f0523d3ca665-43164855.jpg)Kids Play Area\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/02/6311bffc67c2d9-44528578.jpg)Rain Water Harvesting\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/631076c5888133-27323167.jpg)Regular Water Supply\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/6310779b4752a9-36414246.jpg)Security\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f0503360a6e5-25837256.jpg)Swimming Pool\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f051cd060826-66657600.jpg)Wifi\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/08/25/63076704121bd4-42236428.jpg)yoga deck\n\n[#### Pricing, Floor Plans & Room Sizing](javascript:void(0);)\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price () | Floor Plans | Room Sizes | PDF |\n[2 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 2 BHK 